# cell-set updates the value; cell-get reads the new value

[
  cell: [builtin-reactive-cell 1]
  _:    [builtin-cell-set 99 cell]
]
[builtin-cell-get cell]
=== out
Int(99)

=== warn
undefined variable: builtin-reactive-cell at 3:10-3:31
undefined variable: builtin-cell-set at 4:10-4:26
undefined variable: builtin-cell-get at 6:2-6:18
